nd in view for the whole visit\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states the badge must be worn above the waist and in view for the whole visit.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-002\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Visitors return badges at the front desk on their way out.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this claim verbatim in the Returning a badge section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states the cleaning cloth is kept in the top drawer when describing badge return procedures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this claim verbatim in the Returning a badge section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Mark the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list with an N.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this procedure in the If a badge is not returned section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"At the end of the day, send the list of unreturned badges to the security office.\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this claim in the If a badge is not returned section.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Badges that have been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\",\n      \"evid